(text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16. NOT FOR FABRICATION. Prototype firmware is not modified and does not edge GPIO1.\\nEN: 10k to +3V3 and 1 uF to GND. GPIO0: 10k pull-up and a boot button. GPIO3: 10k to GND.\\nGPIO45 and GPIO46 stay open. Do not pull GPIO45 high. USB VBUS is not connected to +3V3." (at 20 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "6e931392-e813-4eed-9325-0a7a4331fba7"))
